Legend Tuner
============

GRID™ Legends and related marks are trademarks of their respective owners.
Legend Tuner is an unofficial fan project and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Feral Interactive, Electronic Arts, or Codemasters. No GRID Legends
game code, assets, or game data files are included in this repository.

The sanitized preferences sample in testdata/ is included solely to exercise
